    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Activated Flooded Strand before playing Scalding Tarn from hand. Playing the land drop first is free and preserves more options. More critically, based on the 'After' note showing they discarded to 7, they appear to not have cast Stoneforge Mystic this turn despite having access to white mana after fetching, which would have been far better than discarding a card.",
